  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide safer transfusion services for patients at the partner institutions through increased competencies and a wider understanding of global transfusion medicine among staff. This will be acheived by experience obtained during exchange periods between blood transfusion centres with a different cultural, religious and economical background.</narrative>
  </description>
